<title>CROATIA: Croatian Nov unemployment unchanged at 15.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatian Nov unemployment unchanged at 15.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	 NOVEMBER     OCTOBER    NOV '95</p>
<p> total unemployed	     266,644	267,619    245,585</p>
<p> unemployment rate (pct)     15.7	   15.7	 17.3</p>
<p>NOTES -- The bureau included army, police and farmers in the total workforce for the past few months. Unemployment figures for November 1995 have not been revised yet.</p>
<p>-- Laura Lui, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
